# Savegames through the menus (docs/re/savegames_phase8.md), 1280x720, 60 fps
# clock, with an EMPTY save dir:
#   mkdir -p /tmp/py_save && rm -f /tmp/py_save/*
#   SDL_VIDEODRIVER=offscreen ./build-game/ProjectY --data data --save-dir /tmp/py_save \
#       --frames 2700 --input tools/ui/savegame_flow.input
# Path: update news -> main -> Singleplayer -> Custom Game -> Start Game ->
# play 10 s -> Esc (statistics) -> Main menu (pause screen 4) -> Save game
# (screen 7) -> slot 1 (singleusersave1.txt, back to the pause screen) ->
# Surrender -> "Yes, I capitulate!" -> aftermath -> Main menu (action 0x17:
# the autosave singleautosave.txt, then the main menu) -> Singleplayer -> Load
# game (screen 8: slot 1 and the autosave) -> slot 1 -> loading screen ->
# the loaded game, which runs on and is saved again into slot 2.
# (The original's pause screen has no Load entry: loading is on the single
# player screen.)
